sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Candidate
  participant API
  participant L as LLM provider
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor E as Employer
  C->>API: GET /candidate/applications/preview?job_id
  C->>API: POST /candidate/jobs/{id}/cover-letters/generate (consent required)
  API->>L: confirmed facts + job, tagged as untrusted data
  L-->>API: letter JSON
  API->>API: unsupported-claim checks (skills, numbers, organizations)
  API-->>C: draft v1 + flags
  C->>API: POST /candidate/jobs/{id}/cover-letters (edited, v2)
  C->>API: POST /candidate/applications {confirm: true} + Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: idempotency lookup, job published, external, duplicate checks
  API->>DB: TX application(submitted) + snapshot + documents + history + key
  API->>DB: notifications (candidate, company members)
  API-->>C: 201 created (replay returns 200 with the same application)
  E->>API: GET /employer/applications/{id} (records first_viewed_at)
  E->>API: POST /employer/applications/{id}/status {shortlisted}
  API->>DB: state machine, history, notify candidate
